  "summary": "List every path from node 0 to the last node of a DAG.",
  "statement": "`graph[i]` lists the nodes you can go to from node `i` in a directed acyclic graph with nodes `0..n-1`.\nReturn every path from `0` to `n - 1`, in lexicographic order.",
